do ErmirLoop.play_bgm()
join Ermir (Smug) right [animation="Bounce In" length="0.0"]
join Seyche left [animation="Bounce In" length="0.0"]
Ermir: Hah! [pause=0.4]You still haven’t lost your spark huh Seyche?
