Ermir (Bored): Of course I do! Styrmir? [pause=0.8]The grumpy guy,[pause=0.3] big wings...[pause=0.4] Beard?
Ermir: Don’t tell me you forgot.
update Seyche (Normal)
[wait time="3.0"]
Ermir: OH my god you forgot.
Ermir (Neutral): That is so...
He seemed serious for a bit.
Ermir (Laugh): Hilarious! [pause=0.8]PHAHAHAHAHAH!
Ermir: Oh...[pause=0.6] Styrmir must be EMBARRASSED from what he did!
